[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13260.07, "timestamp": "03:41:00", "text": "はぁ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13263.19, "timestamp": "03:41:03", "text": "もし私が座標を覚えているなら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13264.95, "timestamp": "03:41:04", "text": "1,200"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13267.349, "timestamp": "03:41:07", "text": "何か。早く戻ってこなくてはならない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13270.63, "timestamp": "03:41:10", "text": "ご存知の通り、消滅する要素があります。あ、待って。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13272.15, "timestamp": "03:41:12", "text": "消滅します。なんてこった。いや、いや、いや、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13273.83, "timestamp": "03:41:13", "text": "いや、いや、いや。それはまずい。それはまずい。おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13277.75, "timestamp": "03:41:17", "text": "いいえ。熱くなっているよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13279.75, "timestamp": "03:41:19", "text": "ああ、なんてことだ。なぜあなたが死んだのか分かりませんが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13289.269, "timestamp": "03:41:29", "text": "座標を削除しましょうか？できた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13292.99, "timestamp": "03:41:32", "text": "あなたが選ぶ私のものをあなたにあげる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13294.87, "timestamp": "03:41:34", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13296.54, "timestamp": "03:41:36", "text": "KDモード。心配しないで。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13297.83, "timestamp": "03:41:37", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13299.51, "timestamp": "03:41:39", "text": "おお、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13303.03, "timestamp": "03:41:43", "text": "F2キーを切り替える方法ですよね？ F1。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13306.389, "timestamp": "03:41:46", "text": "いいえ、F4ではありません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13307.91, "timestamp": "03:41:47", "text": "F6。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13312.389, "timestamp": "03:41:52", "text": "クリエイティブな仕事に切り替えるにはどうすればいいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13316.55, "timestamp": "03:41:56", "text": "私はオペレーターを持っていません。"}]